<p><strong>Example 4: To create a table with a Local Secondary Index</strong></p>
<p>The following example uses the specified attributes and key schema to create a table named <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">MusicCollection</span></code> with a Local Secondary Index named <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">AlbumTitleIndex</span></code>.</p>
<div class="highlight-default notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><span class="n">aws</span> <span class="n">dynamodb</span> <span class="n">create</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">table</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">table</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">name</span> <span class="n">MusicCollection</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">attribute</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">definitions</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">Artist</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">AttributeType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">S</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">SongTitle</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">AttributeType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">S</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">AlbumTitle</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">AttributeType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">S</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">key</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">schema</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">Artist</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">KeyType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">HASH</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">SongTitle</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">KeyType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">RANGE</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">provisioned</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">throughput</span> <span class="n">ReadCapacityUnits</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">10</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">WriteCapacityUnits</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">5</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">local</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">secondary</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">indexes</span> \
        <span class="s2">&quot;[</span>
            <span class="p">{</span>
                \<span class="s2">&quot;IndexName</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">: </span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">AlbumTitleIndex</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">,</span>
                \<span class="s2">&quot;KeySchema</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">: [</span>
                    <span class="p">{</span>\<span class="s2">&quot;AttributeName</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">: </span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">Artist</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">,</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">KeyType</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">:</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">HASH</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">},</span>
                    <span class="p">{</span>\<span class="s2">&quot;AttributeName</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">: </span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">AlbumTitle</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">,</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">KeyType</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">:</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">RANGE</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">}</span>
                <span class="p">],</span>
                \<span class="s2">&quot;Projection</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">: {</span>
                    \<span class="s2">&quot;ProjectionType</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">: </span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">INCLUDE</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">,</span>
                    \<span class="s2">&quot;NonKeyAttributes</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">: [</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">Genre</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">, </span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">Year</span><span class="se">\&quot;</span><span class="s2">]</span>
                <span class="p">}</span>
            <span class="p">}</span>
        <span class="p">]</span><span class="s2">&quot;</span>
</pre></div>
</div>
