<p>For more information, see <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/WorkingWithTables.Basics.html">Basic Operations for Tables</a> in the <em>Amazon DynamoDB Developer Guide</em>.</p>
<p><strong>Example 7: To create a table with Streams enabled</strong></p>
<p>The following example creates a table called <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">GameScores</span></code> with DynamoDB Streams enabled. Both new and old images of each item will be written to the stream.</p>
<div class="highlight-default notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><span class="n">aws</span> <span class="n">dynamodb</span> <span class="n">create</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">table</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">table</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">name</span> <span class="n">GameScores</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">attribute</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">definitions</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">UserId</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">AttributeType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">S</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">GameTitle</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">AttributeType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">S</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">key</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">schema</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">UserId</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">KeyType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">HASH</span> <span class="n">AttributeName</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">GameTitle</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">KeyType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">RANGE</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">provisioned</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">throughput</span> <span class="n">ReadCapacityUnits</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">10</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">WriteCapacityUnits</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">5</span> \
    <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">stream</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">specification</span> <span class="n">StreamEnabled</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">TRUE</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="n">StreamViewType</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">NEW_AND_OLD_IMAGES</span>
</pre></div>
</div>
